sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Emp as Employee
    participant UI as Web Frontend (Leaves View)
    participant Ctrl as LeaveController
    participant Val as LeaveValidationService
    participant Queue as Custom PHP Queue (FIFO)
    actor HR as Administrator / HR
    participant DB as MySQL (InnoDB via PDO)
    participant Audit as Activity & Notification Service

    %% Stage 1: Employee Filing & Validation
    Note over Emp, DB: Stage 1: Leave Request Filing & Server-Side Validation
    Emp->>UI: Selects Leave Type, Start Date, End Date, Reason
    UI->>Ctrl: POST /leaves/apply (form data + CSRF)
    Ctrl->>Val: validateFilingRequest(employee_id, type_id, start, end)
    
    Val->>DB: Check employee status == 'Active'
    Val->>DB: Check leave_type status == 'Active'
    Val->>Val: Validate date format & start_date <= end_date
    Val->>Val: Calculate Working Days (Monday–Friday excl. weekends)
    
    alt Date Format Invalid OR start > end
        Val-->>Ctrl: Error: Invalid Date Range
        Ctrl-->>UI: 422 Unprocessable (Display Date Range Error)
    else Working Days <= 0
        Val-->>Ctrl: Error: Zero working days selected
        Ctrl-->>UI: 422 Unprocessable (Display Weekend Selection Notice)
    else Valid Working Days
        Val->>DB: Query current year leave_balances.remaining_days
        alt Requested Days > Remaining Days
            Val-->>Ctrl: Error: Insufficient Leave Balance
            Ctrl-->>UI: 422 Unprocessable (Display Insufficient Balance Alert)
        else Sufficient Balance
            Val->>DB: Check overlapping requests (status IN ('Pending', 'Approved'))
            alt Overlap Found
                Val-->>Ctrl: Error: Overlapping Leave Period Detected
                Ctrl-->>UI: 422 Unprocessable (Display Overlap Warning)
            else No Overlap
                Ctrl->>DB: INSERT INTO leave_requests (..., status='Pending')
                Ctrl->>Audit: recordLog(LEAVE_FILED) & notifyHR()
                Audit->>DB: INSERT INTO activity_logs, INSERT INTO notifications
                Ctrl-->>UI: 200 OK -> Redirect to /leaves/history (Flash: Submitted)
            end
        end
    end

    %% Stage 2: Queue Presentation
    Note over HR, Queue: Stage 2: FIFO Processing Queue
    HR->>Ctrl: GET /leaves/manage
    Ctrl->>DB: SELECT * FROM leave_requests WHERE status='Pending' ORDER BY created_at ASC
    DB-->>Ctrl: Raw pending records
    Ctrl->>Queue: Enqueue all pending requests (maintaining front/rear pointers)
    Queue-->>Ctrl: Formatted FIFO queue
    Ctrl-->>HR: Render Pending Requests Queue (Front request highlighted)

    %% Stage 3: Transaction-Safe Approval
    Note over HR, DB: Stage 3: ACID Transaction-Safe Approval Protocol
    HR->>Ctrl: POST /leaves/approve (request_id)
    Ctrl->>DB: PDO::beginTransaction()
    
    Ctrl->>DB: SELECT * FROM leave_requests WHERE id = :id FOR UPDATE
    Note right of DB: Row-level lock acquired to prevent race conditions
    
    alt Request status != 'Pending'
        Ctrl->>DB: PDO::rollBack()
        Ctrl-->>HR: 409 Conflict: Request was already processed
    else Employee Inactive OR Leave Type Inactive
        Ctrl->>DB: PDO::rollBack()
        Ctrl-->>HR: 422 Error: Employee or Leave Type is no longer active
    else Valid for Approval
        Ctrl->>DB: SELECT remaining_days FROM leave_balances WHERE employee_id = :emp AND leave_type_id = :type FOR UPDATE
        alt remaining_days < request.number_of_days
            Ctrl->>DB: PDO::rollBack()
            Ctrl-->>HR: 422 Error: Balance shortage detected during approval
        else Balance Confirmed
            Ctrl->>DB: UPDATE leave_requests SET status = 'Approved', approved_by = :uid, approved_at = NOW() WHERE id = :id
            Ctrl->>DB: UPDATE leave_balances SET used_days = used_days + :days, remaining_days = remaining_days - :days WHERE ...
            Ctrl->>DB: INSERT INTO activity_logs (APPROVE_LEAVE)
            Ctrl->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications (target=employee, msg='Leave Approved')
            Ctrl->>DB: PDO::commit()
            Note right of DB: ACID Transaction Committed Successfully
            Ctrl-->>HR: 200 OK (Flash: Leave Approved & Balance Deducted)
        end
    end

    %% Stage 4: Rejection Protocol (No Deduction)
    Note over HR, DB: Stage 4: Rejection Protocol
    opt HR Rejects Request
        HR->>Ctrl: POST /leaves/reject (request_id, reason)
        Ctrl->>DB: UPDATE leave_requests SET status = 'Rejected' WHERE id = :id AND status = 'Pending'
        Ctrl->>DB: INSERT INTO activity_logs (REJECT_LEAVE)
        Ctrl->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications (target=employee, msg='Leave Rejected')
        Note right of DB: Balance records remain untouched
        Ctrl-->>HR: 200 OK (Flash: Leave Rejected)
    end
